#: ../../source/development.rst:4 f7cae83385784f528b5826f5da3b3d53
msgid "Development and internals"
msgstr "开发与内部实现"

#: ../../source/development.rst:6 56e0d51f442541229d837a4a9936e5cb
msgid ""
"This page describes how ``socid_extractor`` is laid out on disk, how the "
"test suite is organised, and what the continuous-integration pipeline "
"enforces. If you are here to contribute a new extraction rule, start with "
":doc:`adding-a-scheme` and use this page as the reference for testing and "
"CI."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍 ``socid_extractor`` "
"在磁盘上的布局、测试套件的组织方式，以及持续集成流水线强制执行的内容。如果你是来贡献一条新的提取规则，请从 :doc:`adding-a-scheme`"
" 开始，并把本页作为测试与 CI 的参考。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:12 60e0a6b4679a4cdfad4b2a06de4955a2
msgid "Package layout"
msgstr "软件包布局"

#: ../../source/development.rst:14 ca2e4f271ac842deb9d7e0b192c60803
msgid ""
"All library code lives under ``socid_extractor/``. The repository root also "
"carries ``run.py``, a thin entry point that calls ``cli.run()`` so you can "
"run the tool without installing it."
msgstr ""
"所有库代码都位于 ``socid_extractor/`` 下。仓库根目录还有 ``run.py``\\ ，这是一个调用 ``cli.run()`` "
"的轻量入口点，让你无需安装即可运行本工具。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:22 02d869e1ae5e4f348651aab9511a5640
msgid "Module"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../source/development.rst:23 c3bda8d4af0447548d3f8191865d95b8
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../../source/development.rst:24 bde306f9771441ef940f6b23d0f1fa4a
msgid "``__init__.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:25 56c35de5fa5a4f9fae9a6d84545ce7c8
msgid ""
"Package version metadata; re-exports ``extract``, ``parse``, ``mutate_url`` "
"and ``parse_cookies`` from ``main`` (``parse_cookies`` ultimately comes from"
" ``utils``)."
msgstr ""
"软件包版本元数据；从 ``main`` 重新导出 ``extract``\\ 、\\ ``parse``\\ 、\\ ``mutate_url`` 和 "
"``parse_cookies``\\ （\\ ``parse_cookies`` 最终来自 ``utils``\\ ）。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:28 95eb98f1e5054ccc97cf4e7b51a9684a
msgid "``main.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:29 3a29abcf3e574c12aaeb955fa0bbaca5
msgid ""
"``HEADERS``, ``parse()``, ``mutate_url()``, ``extract()`` and the shared "
"helpers ``transform()`` / ``map_fields()``. The central extraction pipeline."
msgstr ""
"``HEADERS``\\ 、\\ ``parse()``\\ 、\\ ``mutate_url()``\\ 、\\ ``extract()`` "
"以及共享辅助函数 ``transform()`` / ``map_fields()``\\ 。核心提取流水线。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:32 4679a3b7f1354f9db4c39053602722f5
msgid "``schemes.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:33 fbcfd376beb540798e31b84ff62cd85f
msgid ""
"Defines ``schemes`` — one dict entry per extraction method (site / API "
"shape). Imports the shared helpers from ``utils`` (``from .utils import *``)"
" so scheme lambdas can use them. This is the main place to add or change "
"extraction rules."
msgstr ""
"定义 ``schemes`` —— 每个提取方法（站点 / API 形态）对应一个字典条目。从 ``utils`` 导入共享辅助函数（\\ ``from"
" .utils import *``\\ ），供提取方案的 lambda 使用。这里是添加或修改提取规则的主要位置。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:37 47709a2648024f43b338fea2364ee4fb
msgid "``cli.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:38 6c18af16cbe14c32acfd9f377d47a0e4
msgid ""
"Argument parsing, logging setup, cookie loading, optional activation, and "
"orchestration of ``parse`` / ``mutate_url`` / ``extract`` for ``--url`` or "
"``--file``. The optional ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-hint`` flag uses "
"``url_relevance``."
msgstr ""
"参数解析、日志配置、Cookie 加载、可选的激活步骤，以及为 ``--url`` 或 ``--file`` 编排 ``parse`` / "
"``mutate_url`` / ``extract``\\ 。可选的 ``--skip-fetch-if-no-url-hint`` 标志使用 "
"``url_relevance``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:42 cdbed1fc1a27463a86d589b148f6066b
msgid "``url_relevance.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:43 79b504a7367144ae804598b87df42271
msgid ""
"``check_url_relevance(url)`` — substring hints from each scheme's optional "
"``url_hints`` plus tokens derived from the scheme name; used only by the CLI"
" to skip HTTP when no hint matches."
msgstr ""
"``check_url_relevance(url)`` —— 来自每个提取方案可选的 ``url_hints`` "
"的子串提示，加上从方案名派生的标记；仅由 CLI 用于在没有提示匹配时跳过 HTTP 请求。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:46 4ed88ade4dc741808fcf3c512954ab91
msgid "``utils.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:47 d0940c122af64f0282c4f34a2158eec4
msgid ""
"Cookie parsing and Netscape cookie-jar import, datetime helpers, URL "
"enrichment, Facebook UID from graph URLs, Yandex avatar URLs, and string "
"utilities used by schemes."
msgstr ""
"Cookie 解析与 Netscape cookie-jar 导入、日期时间辅助函数、URL 富化、从 graph URL 提取 Facebook "
"UID、Yandex 头像 URL，以及提取方案使用的字符串工具。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:50 93304bad0fdd4c1c9a366c4cc7877a71
msgid "``activation.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:51 d890a8c8b1974893a6cf06435af41410
msgid ""
"Functions referenced by ``--activation`` that obtain tokens or headers (for "
"example Twitter guest activation, Vimeo JWT) before the main request."
msgstr ""
"由 ``--activation`` 引用的函数，在主请求之前获取 token 或请求头（例如 Twitter 访客激活、Vimeo JWT）。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:54 969eb81135f441dda4564777334193ef
msgid "``postprocessor.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:55 0ef65600073b4273a63df1b67b38b2d2
msgid ""
"Classes such as ``Gravatar``, ``EmailToUsername`` and "
"``YandexUsernameToEmail``; listed in ``POSTPROCESSORS`` and run on every "
"successful field dict after scheme extraction."
msgstr ""
"诸如 ``Gravatar``\\ 、\\ ``EmailToUsername`` 和 ``YandexUsernameToEmail`` "
"之类的类；列在 ``POSTPROCESSORS`` 中，在方案提取之后对每个成功的字段字典运行。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:58 69447f1d28da41ccb954db17f097aa5b
msgid "``__main__.py``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:59 cf938c287c0d4b15ad6fd48c76d12175
msgid "Delegates to ``cli.run()`` so ``python -m socid_extractor`` works."
msgstr "委托给 ``cli.run()``\\ ，使 ``python -m socid_extractor`` 可用。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:62 a3c2e9b8cb7b44a2a56468c4efb8e482
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/development.rst:64 744d1ba3105f45c7ba5f6cfef6edd25b
msgid ""
"``tests/test_e2e.py`` is the main test suite. A test typically calls "
"``parse(url, ...)`` to fetch a live page, then ``extract(text)`` and asserts"
" on keys in the returned dict. Some tests pass custom ``headers`` or "
"cookies."
msgstr ""
"``tests/test_e2e.py`` 是主测试套件。一个测试通常调用 ``parse(url, ...)`` 抓取实时页面，再调用 "
"``extract(text)`` 并对返回字典中的键做断言。有些测试会传入自定义 ``headers`` 或 cookie。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:68 e04328b61eb741dc80e9130368956301
msgid ""
"**One end-to-end test per scheme.** Every extraction method — each named "
"entry in ``schemes`` in ``socid_extractor/schemes.py`` — should have at "
"least one end-to-end test in ``tests/test_e2e.py`` that exercises a real URL"
" (or the public JSON endpoint Maigret uses) and asserts on extracted fields."
msgstr ""
"**每个提取方案一个端到端测试。** 每个提取方法 —— 即 ``socid_extractor/schemes.py`` 中 ``schemes`` "
"里的每个命名条目 —— 都应在 ``tests/test_e2e.py`` 中至少有一个端到端测试，用真实 URL（或 Maigret 使用的公开 "
"JSON 端点）进行验证，并对提取出的字段做断言。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:73 87f7769c9f9e4c36acbdb4cf174686cd
msgid ""
"Add the test in the same commit as a new or changed scheme when possible."
msgstr "尽可能在添加或修改提取方案的同一次提交中一并加入测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:74 e4e77373ef8c4c32bc03aac05b39f28a
msgid ""
"Name the test function ``test_<something>_e2e`` or follow the existing "
"``test_<site>`` pattern."
msgstr "把测试函数命名为 ``test_<something>_e2e``\\ ，或沿用现有的 ``test_<site>`` 模式。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:76 82b513f879db4186af5002e189ce2b2b
msgid ""
"In the test **docstring**, put the exact scheme name(s) from ``schemes.py``,"
" one per line. ``revision.py`` uses this docstring-to-scheme-name link to "
"associate tests with methods when it regenerates ``METHODS.md``."
msgstr ""
"在测试的 **docstring** 中，逐行写上来自 ``schemes.py`` 的确切方案名。\\ ``revision.py`` 在重新生成 "
"``METHODS.md`` 时，通过这种 docstring 到方案名的关联把测试与方法对应起来。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:80 0dc0242471b14d9db4a0f33dc31f32ce
msgid ""
"Where a live call is too flaky, add a fast offline check in a small module "
"test (for example ``tests/test_socid_improvements.py`` with a saved "
"HTML/JSON snippet) *in addition* to the e2e policy, not as a substitute for "
"it."
msgstr ""
"若实时调用过于不稳定，可在小型模块测试中增加一个快速离线检查（例如 ``tests/test_socid_improvements.py`` 配合保存的"
" HTML/JSON 片段），作为端到端策略的 *补充*，而非替代。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:84 87b4dd9acf99415fb37abc746e736637
msgid ""
"Cookie-based scenarios may use files under ``tests/`` (for example "
"``*.cookies``). The default CI run excludes tests whose names match "
"``cookies`` via ``-k 'not cookies'``."
msgstr ""
"基于 Cookie 的场景可以使用 ``tests/`` 下的文件（例如 ``*.cookies``\\ ）。默认的 CI 运行通过 ``-k 'not"
" cookies'`` 排除名称匹配 ``cookies`` 的测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:89 af9266f81a944b51a540ab1f6273404f
msgid "Pytest markers"
msgstr "Pytest 标记"

#: ../../source/development.rst:91 0d693984e3004533a7ccd67b3f75eabd
msgid ""
"Markers are defined in ``pyproject.toml`` under "
"``[tool.pytest.ini_options]``."
msgstr "标记在 ``pyproject.toml`` 的 ``[tool.pytest.ini_options]`` 下定义。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:97 ccdcfb7ecbcd4395b2d0235c226a6718
msgid "Marker"
msgstr "标记"

#: ../../source/development.rst:98 ab4ec9bc551741d995fe7824e0af8910
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/development.rst:99 e2ee901b8aab43a5815f57dd807630ff
msgid "``github_failed``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:100 d1dce23a4d4c4d369b4bf69bfb1c0401
msgid ""
"Requests from GitHub Actions CI servers are blocked (blocks, geo, and "
"similar). Excluded in CI."
msgstr "来自 GitHub Actions CI 服务器的请求被拦截（封锁、地域限制等）。在 CI 中被排除。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:102 a9b09b50836d4a6ab2e22e06d8b3a38d
msgid "``rate_limited``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:103 f4563816c3bc4d8cb7eb9c47fe72c637
msgid "Anti-bot, captcha, or rate limiting from the site. Excluded in CI."
msgstr "站点的反爬、验证码或限流。在 CI 中被排除。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:104 420b4a731eb1465fa569fade2bbfbfad
msgid "``requires_cookies``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:105 f5540f90559a4e7fb26d8760be887435
msgid "Cookies are required to get content. Documented for selective runs."
msgstr "需要 Cookie 才能获取内容。记录在案以便按需运行。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:107 35e62cdbab86479ca4a354ebbad1230f
msgid ""
"If a site blocks GitHub Actions, mark the test "
"``@pytest.mark.github_failed`` or ``@pytest.mark.rate_limited`` and document"
" why — the test still counts locally and for coverage intent, and CI simply "
"excludes it with ``-m 'not github_failed and not rate_limited'``."
msgstr ""
"如果某站点封锁 GitHub Actions，给测试标上 ``@pytest.mark.github_failed`` 或 "
"``@pytest.mark.rate_limited`` 并说明原因 —— 该测试在本地和覆盖率意图上仍然计入，CI 只是用 ``-m 'not "
"github_failed and not rate_limited'`` 将其排除。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:113 fd9e29a38367432d87f12e232d3366b0
msgid "Installing test/dev extras"
msgstr "安装 test/dev 附加依赖"

#: ../../source/development.rst:115 74e3c2e101224af0b96ef7482c967c94
msgid ""
"All test, lint, type-check and format tools are declared in "
"``pyproject.toml`` under ``[project.optional-dependencies]``."
msgstr ""
"所有测试、lint、类型检查和格式化工具都在 ``pyproject.toml`` 的 ``[project.optional-"
"dependencies]`` 下声明。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:126 91a6c0112c1547e8ac20d3167c3b6915
msgid "CI installs the ``[dev]`` extra."
msgstr "CI 安装 ``[dev]`` 附加依赖。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:129 3e9d22d1313a49968cc5cc51cd5d9ced
msgid "Running the suite locally"
msgstr "在本地运行测试套件"

#: ../../source/development.rst:135 7ccee129e1ef43c3a44e098219b0796a
msgid ""
"``-n 10`` runs the suite across parallel workers using **pytest-xdist** "
"(shipped in the ``[test]`` / ``[dev]`` extra). Omit ``-n 10`` if you did not"
" install xdist."
msgstr ""
"``-n 10`` 使用 **pytest-xdist**\\ （随 ``[test]`` / ``[dev]`` "
"附加依赖提供）在多个并行工作进程中运行测试套件。如果你没有安装 xdist，请省略 ``-n 10``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:138 7204a58d4fd14d9f922f0dc99ae893fc
msgid ""
"The ``-k`` and ``-m`` filters match what CI runs, with the added parallelism"
" for speed."
msgstr "``-k`` 和 ``-m`` 过滤条件与 CI 运行的一致，只是额外加了并行以提速。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:141 4542dd1a5c1047e98211707badd3cd35
msgid ""
"``tests/reformat.sh`` is a helper script that turns lines of the form ``key:"
" value`` into ``assert info.get(\"key\") == \"value\"`` patterns in "
"``test_e2e.py`` (macOS ``sed`` syntax). Use it after pasting CLI output into"
" the test file."
msgstr ""
"``tests/reformat.sh`` 是一个辅助脚本，它把形如 ``key: value`` 的行转换成 ``test_e2e.py`` 中的 "
"``assert info.get(\"key\") == \"value\"`` 模式（macOS ``sed`` 语法）。把 CLI "
"输出粘贴进测试文件后使用它。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:147 7223e9516b4348afb3d824dab2903b0f
msgid "revision.py"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/development.rst:149 976af9fff21f447f9e8209eb26291f32
