"It regenerates ``METHODS.md`` from the tests and schemes. Specifically, it:"
msgstr "它根据测试和提取方案重新生成 ``METHODS.md``\\ 。具体来说，它会："

#: ../../source/development.rst:157 0f61be7d4e964333aaa8c6c2965bd3b3
msgid "reads the pytest marker descriptions from ``pyproject.toml``;"
msgstr "从 ``pyproject.toml`` 读取 pytest 标记的描述；"

#: ../../source/development.rst:158 b8eaef632112413c8701d227a8ffad22
msgid ""
"loads the tests from ``tests/test_e2e.py`` and the schemes from "
"``socid_extractor/schemes.py``;"
msgstr "从 ``tests/test_e2e.py`` 加载测试，从 ``socid_extractor/schemes.py`` 加载提取方案；"

#: ../../source/development.rst:160 dc18206b8ccc4da3892eac4fa59dc00a
msgid ""
"associates tests with scheme names via the test docstrings (one method name "
"per line) or heuristic name matching;"
msgstr "通过测试的 docstring（每行一个方法名）或启发式的名称匹配，把测试与方案名关联起来；"

#: ../../source/development.rst:162 3ba9644980cf4513b2c52fb8fa3c6274
msgid ""
"overwrites ``METHODS.md`` with a table of methods, test links, and notes "
"(markers, skip reasons); and"
msgstr "用一张包含方法、测试链接和备注（标记、跳过原因）的表格覆盖 ``METHODS.md``\\ ；以及"

#: ../../source/development.rst:164 fe75fd0fdd6440389322ddfbc7f3d42a
msgid "prints how many methods have no matching test."
msgstr "打印有多少方法没有对应的测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:166 380898fa95044bcf845f9cca3b048636
msgid ""
"Keep the docstrings in your tests aligned with the scheme names in "
"``schemes`` when you want accurate coverage reporting."
msgstr "当你希望覆盖率报告准确时，请让测试中的 docstring 与 ``schemes`` 中的方案名保持一致。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:170 908fd04750c7405e9dbb6e9760037e26
msgid "Continuous integration"
msgstr "持续集成"

#: ../../source/development.rst:172 25636310d65f41499c090fa5abf93671
msgid ""
"``.github/workflows/python-package.yml`` runs on pushes and pull requests to"
" ``master``. It installs the ``[dev]`` extra and runs across Python **3.10, "
"3.11, 3.12, 3.13 and 3.14**."
msgstr ""
"``.github/workflows/python-package.yml`` 在向 ``master`` 推送和发起拉取请求时运行。它安装 "
"``[dev]`` 附加依赖，并在 Python **3.10、3.11、3.12、3.13 和 3.14** 上运行。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:176 223328e5ca2c4c559db6683e82679ba1
msgid ""
"**flake8** is the only hard gate. CI runs ``flake8 --select=E9,F63,F7,F82``,"
" so only real syntax errors and undefined names fail the build; a separate "
"warning-only pass reports complexity and line length."
msgstr ""
"**flake8** 是唯一的硬性门禁。CI 运行 ``flake8 --select=E9,F63,F7,F82``\\ "
"，因此只有真正的语法错误和未定义名称才会让构建失败；另有一趟仅告警的检查报告复杂度和行长。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:179 f39558898fee45439bb2f6e5e5322d55
msgid ""
"**mypy** runs as ``mypy socid_extractor/`` (with stub overrides in "
"``[[tool.mypy.overrides]]``)."
msgstr ""
"**mypy** 以 ``mypy socid_extractor/`` 运行（在 ``[[tool.mypy.overrides]]`` "
"中带有存根覆盖）。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:181 2ae5884af3a34c32812237ead1cd6442
msgid ""
"**pytest** runs ``pytest -k 'not cookies' -m 'not github_failed and not "
"rate_limited' --reruns 3 --reruns-delay 30``, using pytest-rerunfailures to "
"absorb flaky network tests."
msgstr ""
"**pytest** 运行 ``pytest -k 'not cookies' -m 'not github_failed and not "
"rate_limited' --reruns 3 --reruns-delay 30``\\ ，用 pytest-rerunfailures "
"吸收不稳定的网络测试。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:185 3ca223bd43cf4da1b07ace49f3e45f4a
msgid ""
"Publishing to PyPI on release is handled separately by "
"``.github/workflows/python-publish.yml`` using ``python -m build``."
msgstr ""
"发布时向 PyPI 的推送由 ``.github/workflows/python-publish.yml`` 使用 ``python -m "
"build`` 单独处理。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:189 99739df048df4954b5d03305ddc30d16
msgid "Code style"
msgstr "代码风格"

#: ../../source/development.rst:191 9500f205035940f7834397cc7a9c0f2d
msgid ""
"``pyproject.toml`` configures three tools. All three live in the ``[dev]`` "
"extra so contributors can run them locally, but none is a hard CI gate "
"except flake8's error set (``E9,F63,F7,F82``)."
msgstr ""
"``pyproject.toml`` 配置了三个工具。三者都在 ``[dev]`` 附加依赖中，方便贡献者在本地运行，但除了 flake8 "
"的错误集（\\ ``E9,F63,F7,F82``\\ ）之外，没有一个是硬性 CI 门禁。"

#: ../../source/development.rst:199 442ecbce3bfd413e88541009cc76b519
msgid "Tool"
msgstr "工具"

#: ../../source/development.rst:200 6bd4c855fc474168a6e94f9f7fe82230
msgid "Config"
msgstr "配置"

